  "scope": "Local fixed candidate commit only. No push, PR, merge, deploy, permissions, credentials or production counter change.",
  "scientific_caveats": [
    "Isorophus I–IV contrasolar, V solar. Four principal oral plates plus accessories. Complete living relief and plate sampling artistic.",
