    "Placocystites normal Ruta1998 map and actual museum fossil pixels used; pathological HC11 excluded. Historical calcichordate head/gill/tail claims not treated as fact. Normal regional plate count and appendage relations, not a traced specimen.",
    "No source pixels/media or third-party3D meshes incorporated. Consult sources remain local, including failed downloads.",
    "Actual transformed geometry, all parent contacts, global exposure and local cavity floor tests do not alone imply screen readability. Every final single image and supplementary view must be personally reviewed; independent reviewer remains separate.",
